  <data name="HelpBody" xml:space="preserve"><value>Open RedrainCast on both devices: Windows PCs or compatible Android devices. Keep them on the same trusted local network.

On the sender, choose a nearby receiver and Send, or enter the receiver's current IP : Port. On Windows, choose a display or window to share.

Incoming casts are accepted automatically. On this PC, playback opens fullscreen; Enter or F toggles fullscreen and Esc leaves it. Stop the cast from the sender.

This PC pauses receiving while sending and resumes after Stop.

Allow RedrainCast through Windows Firewall on your trusted Private network. Casting is not authenticated or encrypted; do not expose it to the internet.</value><comment>Keep RedrainCast, Windows, Android, IP, Enter, F and Esc identifiers. Preserve paragraphs. Send and Stop refer to localized buttons.</comment></data>
